WEBVTT

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:28.200
Yes. When the special
combat zone collapsed earlier,

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:31.910
it seems to have also caused the rest of
the nearby area to become unstable as well.

00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:34.750
Is this all done by the Sirens?

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:36.750
The Sakura Empire's "Project Orochi"

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:39.450
and that mysterious event
caused by Enterprise...

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.250
I cannot help but feel that
they are related in some way.

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:44.410
In order to thwart whatever
it is the Sirens are plotting...

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:46.830
We can't let the Sakura Empire escape.

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:54.450
Big sis... What's going on?

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:57.700
How would I know...?

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
What are you doing... Big sis?

00:01:12.870 --> 00:01:14.540
Enterprise...

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:54.450
Cold.

00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:56.370
We got separated from the others...

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:58.620
We have to regroup with the fleet, soon.

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:06.950
Oh...

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.450
Ayanami.

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:16.200
The world used to be a simple place.

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:19.160
Fighting was the reason we existed,

00:03:19.160 --> 00:03:21.790
our enemies were invaders from the outside.

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:26.410
In addition, humanity
was backed into a corner.

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:30.620
It was a tough world to live in,
but there was no doubt in our fighting.

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:35.290
To fight. To protect.

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:39.160
Those two things were one
and the same, no contradictions.

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:43.370
But...

00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:55.330
This again...

00:03:56.410 --> 00:04:01.950
Why won't you fight?!
What are you thinking?!

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:06.120
We told you before.
We want to be friends with you.

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:09.580
That's right! We want to be
friends with you, Ayanami--

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:12.540
We're enemies! What are you talking about?!

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:13.660
It doesn't matter.

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:15.450
It does matter!

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:17.660
We are warships...

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:21.040
Fighting the enemy is natural!

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:23.120
No.

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:25.750
We are not that simple.

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:29.120
Watch out!

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:35.410
Stop bullying Ayanami!

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:40.000
Yeah!

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:42.620
Wait! We don't want to fight...

00:04:44.660 --> 00:04:47.040
We won't fall for that!

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:49.790
What are you hanging around for?!
Let's get out of here!

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:53.330
We'll settle this in the future!

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:55.580
We won't be easy on you next time!

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:56.700
Ayanami!

00:04:58.540 --> 00:04:59.660
Javelin!

00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:07.000
Are you all right?

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:10.500
Belfast.

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:13.290
Let us depart. It is not safe here.

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:30.870
This world we live in--
since when has it become so complex?

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:37.410
We face a common enemy, but for some reason,
our guns are pointed at each other.

00:05:47.290 --> 00:05:49.410
I... Why...?

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:16.410
Oh, they're still lost in their concerns.

00:06:16.410 --> 00:06:20.580
They're always together,
but when they cry, they cry alone.

00:06:21.830 --> 00:06:24.870
They're both clumsy, that's what.

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:27.950
Just like you.

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:32.950
Have we... met?

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:39.750
But there is a connection.

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:44.040
We were born with the memories
of warships embedded in us.

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:46.910
A distant sea, beyond
the boundaries of time itself,

00:06:46.910 --> 00:06:50.080
Braiding together countless emotions.

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:54.950
Please do not forget that within you
lie the prayers of humanity.

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:15.830
She's awake!

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:17.000
Dear sister!

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:24.160
Kaga! You're badly hurt,
please don't push yourself.

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:28.540
Fifth carrier division? What happened?

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:36.870
I was fighting the Grey Ghost, and...

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:42.290
Dear sister... Yes...

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:44.200
Where is my dear sister Akagi?!

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:48.450
She's...

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:56.790
What's going to happen next?

00:07:56.790 --> 00:07:59.370
The situation is difficult.

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:01.950
I'm scared...

00:08:01.950 --> 00:08:04.620
There, there. It'll be okay.

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:07.660
I'm so glad you're okay!

00:08:07.660 --> 00:08:10.200
So? What's going on?

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:16.120
I want to ask you the same question.
It's like we're being shown an illusion.

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:23.950
Hmph! Zuikaku is paying
too much attention to Kaga!

00:08:25.790 --> 00:08:27.830
As her big sister, I'm lonely!

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:33.700
We still haven't found Akagi.

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:37.120
The rest of the separated ones
have mostly regrouped.

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:39.660
If she's still not found, then...

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:42.200
Did Grey Ghost really...?

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:49.700
It's too early to give up!
We have to search harder.

00:08:49.700 --> 00:08:52.660
But it's not like we can hang around
here for as long as we please.

00:08:54.330 --> 00:08:59.250
This is a dangerous area. We need to leave.

00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:01.580
Also, there is one more issue.

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:09.750
It won't budge. Did it overheat or something?

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:13.290
Could this be another ploy by the enemy?

00:09:13.290 --> 00:09:15.950
I wonder what happened.

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:22.750
The mass-produced Sirens have shut down...

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:26.500
Not just one, but all of them...?

00:09:30.830 --> 00:09:33.620
Is this related to the weird way
the ocean is right now?

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:37.160
Perhaps it is because the connection
to Orochi has been severed.

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:41.120
Losing the black Mental Cube was a big loss...

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:45.330
If you think about it, though,
this Project Orochi thing...

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:47.040
Shoukaku?

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:51.660
The black Mental Cube,
how we control the Sirens...

00:09:51.660 --> 00:09:55.000
None of those things were
explained to us properly.

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:58.370
Come on, Shoukaku, at a time like this...?

00:09:58.370 --> 00:10:03.120
And that force field-type enchantment?
Or whatever, from Akagi, too.

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:05.370
Too many secrets, don't you think?

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:09.370
The 1st Carrier Division elders...

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:13.250
What are they hiding?

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:32.410
Are you concerned about
that Sakura Empire girl?

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:36.000
You saw.

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:42.040
Yes. I apologize for being late
to come help you.

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:45.250
Um... Aren't you mad at us?

00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:47.200
Excuse me?

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:54.040
Ayanami is our enemy...
But we really don't want to fight her.

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:57.540
But we don't know what to do...

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:01.830
You should continue to dwell on this.

00:11:01.830 --> 00:11:03.290
Huh?

00:11:03.290 --> 00:11:09.080
Keep thinking. We cannot let the situation
continue to make our decisions for us.

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:13.500
Our powers must not be taken so lightly.

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:18.700
We were created to fight, not to destroy.

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:21.200
--Yes!
--Yeah.

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:31.540
This area is especially dangerous.

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:34.750
Please try to regroup with
the fleet as quickly as possible.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:36.540
What about you?

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:40.450
I must find Enterprise.

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:46.370
I am a maid. Being at her side is my duty.

00:11:46.370 --> 00:11:47.790
Laffey will help, too.

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:52.330
But...

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:57.000
We will help find Enterprise.
Let's all go home together.

00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:04.250
What?! Say that again.

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:06.700
Kaga, please calm down!

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:10.950
We are ending our search
for Akagi, effective immediately.

00:12:10.950 --> 00:12:16.250
All ships are to leave this area and
return to Sakura Empire headquarters.

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:20.830
Unacceptable! Akagi is our flagship!

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:23.160
There is no way I will allow you
to leave her behind!

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:28.120
Like you just said, we have lost our flagship,

00:12:28.120 --> 00:12:31.950
and the mass-produced Sirens
are not functional either.

00:12:31.950 --> 00:12:35.450
Our fleet no longer has the ability
to continue the operation.

00:12:35.450 --> 00:12:38.910
We cannot remain in this area anymore.

00:12:38.910 --> 00:12:42.910
We cannot risk the entire fleet for Akagi.

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:46.200
Souryuu... You...!

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:54.000
Dear sister... Dear sister Akagi...

00:12:58.660 --> 00:13:01.200
What else can we do...?

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:04.790
Dear sister Souryuu...

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:13.410
Reporting.

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:18.540
We've tracked down
the main Sakura Empire fleet.

00:13:20.370 --> 00:13:22.790
So we have to do this.

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:27.200
Yes. The power of the Sirens
that they control is too dangerous.

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:30.660
If we let them go now,
this situation could get far worse.

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:37.910
There's no other way... This is war.

00:13:43.080 --> 00:13:47.000
It seems they're not willing
to let us slip away freely.

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:51.330
We can't take them on head-on
in our current state.

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:55.120
Dear sister Souryuu,
please command the retreat.

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:58.250
I will pull the Azur Lane away.

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:01.790
No, I will be the rear guard.

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:03.330
Zuikaku?!

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:06.160
I'm your elder--I can't let you do that!

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:09.750
This isn't something you
should feel responsible for.

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:15.910
Shoukaku... I really
understand how Kaga feels.

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:22.000
I think, if I lost my own sister,
I would break down as well.

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:33.000
It's okay, Zuikaku. Your sister
will always be by your side.

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:35.870
Take care of yourselves, both of you.

00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:48.200
It's fine, all good! I might not
look it, but I'm a lucky ship!

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:53.950
Take care of everyone, please.

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:55.830
Shoukaku...

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:33.290
They took off.

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:38.200
I don't know what to do.

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:40.830
Ayanami...

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:41.910
But...

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:55.120
Dodged...

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:05.000
"Tester"

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:05.000
The human race
continues to entertain me.

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:08.540
They despise war, yet choose to fight.

00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:11.620
Their internal contradictions
are simply incorrigible.

00:16:11.620 --> 00:16:16.370
They are a mirror, reflecting
the thoughts and histories of humans.

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:20.750
Conflict is the core of humankind. Yes...

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:25.410
War never changes, regardless of era.

00:16:25.410 --> 00:16:27.790
What, did you pick that up?

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:30.830
Yes. She still has a role to play.

00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:40.580
Thanks to Enterprise, the black Mental Cube
has acquired a huge amount of data.

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:43.410
It's enough for the project.

00:16:43.410 --> 00:16:46.040
Yes. Finally.

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:49.290
Yes. Orochi awakens.

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:03.450
Grey Ghost?!

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:23.500
Zuikaku!

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:24.790
Sister?!

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:42.410
Big sis?

00:19:24.200 --> 00:19:26.750
Someone tell me...

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:31.250
Will there ever come a day
when all conflict ends?

00:19:31.250 --> 00:19:35.790
You know the answer to
that question better than anyone.

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:45.950
Ah, I see...

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:49.910
War never changes.

00:19:55.080 --> 00:19:56.950
Grey Ghost!

00:20:18.910 --> 00:20:21.250
I'm sorry, Shoukaku...

00:20:37.370 --> 00:20:38.580
Ayanami?!

00:20:45.120 --> 00:20:49.250
I don't know what I should do.

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:50.750
But...!

00:20:50.750 --> 00:20:55.200
I know I don't like this!

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:17.540
Oh... Wait...

00:21:29.410 --> 00:21:30.660
Go!

00:21:30.660 --> 00:21:31.750
--Yes!
--Yeah!

00:21:40.450 --> 00:21:42.290
Deactivating self-imposed limiter!

00:22:06.200 --> 00:22:08.790
Too heavy...!

00:22:19.450 --> 00:22:22.540
Climb up quickly...!

00:22:25.370 --> 00:22:27.700
Thank you.

00:22:28.870 --> 00:22:34.290
<i>The ripples seeing each other</i>

00:22:34.290 --> 00:22:40.040
<i>Are messages exchanged with you</i>

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:46.080
<i>Connecting us across this blue ocean</i>

00:22:46.080 --> 00:22:51.700
<i>Guideposts of light</i>

00:22:51.700 --> 00:22:57.370
<i>Have you met someone nice?</i>

00:22:57.370 --> 00:23:03.040
<i>Are your days filled with smiles?</i>

00:23:03.040 --> 00:23:08.540
<i>Filling your melancholy eyes with light</i>

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:13.620
<i>When the starshine wanes in them</i>

00:23:14.620 --> 00:23:19.500
<i>I'm close to you</i>

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:25.620
<i>Always by your side</i>

00:23:25.620 --> 00:23:30.870
<i>you can't see the next day</i>

00:23:30.870 --> 00:23:37.160
<i>I am calling out to your heart</i>

00:23:37.160 --> 00:23:42.080
<i>Please stay with me</i>

00:23:42.080 --> 00:23:48.120
<i>Please don't give up</i>

00:23:48.120 --> 00:23:57.200
<i>Until the morning comes</i>
<i>when we can hold hands</i>
